:''Not to be confused with the [[Inactive Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Inactive Aku Altar]].''
The '''Aku Altar''' (悪魔城, ''Akuma-Jō'', '''Devil Fortress''' or '''Devil Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

